Subject: [PATCH 3/5] fill s2b-efficiency: prove
 exists_toOracleAdversary_of_bitCodec (T4)

New helper module Games/Efficiency/OracleBridge: the history translator
bridgePre (polyTimeComputable_iterateEmit with the step pairSndD), the move
translator bridgePost (canonicity by re-encoding), their correspondence
(bridgePre_encodeHist, bridgePost_spec) and the evaluation lemma
eval_buildTree_bridge (induction on the budget). B' is NUPPT.exists_comp of B
with the two translators; the coins are carried by NUPPT.coinsCongr. T4's
sketch is updated to the delivered proof.
